# The stem's files this node carries MODIFIED, each with the reason it differs.
#
# WHAT THIS IS FOR. `.offshoot-omissions` lists what this repo does not carry
# from its stem; this lists what it carries and changes. Everything else is the
# stem's byte for byte or this repo's own, so a diff against the stem reads as:
# the additions, the omissions (listed there) and these. A modified file is a
# conflict on every cascade that touches it, so each one here is a cost paid on
# purpose, and the reason says what it buys. A cascade reviewer meeting one of
# these files knows the node's side is a decision; meeting any other modified
# file, it is drift.
#
# AND IT IS CHECKED, by `scripts/check-divergences.mjs` (the tree's one copy,
# from template-svelte), run by `web/test/offshoot-divergences.test.ts` and by
# `scripts/apply-omissions.sh` during a merge: it fails on a modified file with
# no entry, on an entry whose file no longer differs, and on an entry with no
# reason. A file at the stem's OLD version is drift, not a divergence:
# `scripts/check-stem-drift.mjs` catches that.
#
# FORMAT. One file per line: its path, then its reason. `#` starts a comment.
# A line `[<branch>]` starts a section; this repo has one node, `main`, so it
# has none: every entry is what template-svelte-shadcn `main` modifies from
# template-svelte-tailwind `main`. A child REPO never keeps these entries: its
# list is its own, written against this repo, and until it writes one it
# carries this file unchanged and the check says it has none.

# The workspace
pnpm-lock.yaml                                         the lockfile with shadcn's dependencies added (bits-ui, vaul-svelte, mode-watcher, sonner, ...)
web/package.json                                       shadcn-svelte's dependencies: bits-ui, vaul-svelte, lucide, mode-watcher, sonner and the class helpers
web/svelte.config.js                                   the `$ui` alias, which kit paints the building blocks of core/ui

# The kit
web/src/app.css                                        shadcn's theme tokens and dark variant, tw-animate, the forms plugin dropped, the overlay layers' z-index scale
web/src/routes/+layout.svelte                          the mode watcher configured by web-config.json's `theme`, and the overlay layers rendered from core/ui/layers with the notices and the progress bar in theirs
web/src/lib/core/notifications/NotificationCard.svelte the notification card painted on shadcn's Card and Button
web/src/lib/components/NavigationProgress.svelte       no z-index of its own: it renders inside the "progress" overlay layer, which decides what it covers
